-- The player swims in the air (Stand's Air Swim): the config flag IS_SWIMMING (65) of the ped is held on every frame, so
-- the game plays the swim motion where there is no water.
--
--     local swim = Atdar.util.game.players.user.air_swim
--
--     swim.enable()
--     swim.disable()
return Atdar.util.game.players.user.ticker.config_flag("AirSwim", 65)
